error: [SemanticError GALA-E0037] $DIR/main.gala:7:45 closure crossing a concurrency boundary captures function value "f" (type func() int) — a function value may itself close over mutable state, so it cannot cross the boundary unless it is Sendable (hint: declare the parameter as `f Sendable[func() int]` — the Sendable bound requires each caller to pass a closure whose own captures are shareable, and propagates the check to the call site where the closure is written)
